为了提高cube核和vector计算的并行度，cude计算时多核切分M轴和N轴，而vector计算因为依赖N轴只多核切分M轴，每次cude计算完一整行singleM时，vector才开始计算singleM的数据
理解了。C0 用 2D (M×N) 多核切分提升 Cube 吞吐，V0 仅沿 M 切分（SwiGLU 需完整 N），按 M-block 流水衔接。重新推导。


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[Step 1: 切分决策 — 修订版 v2]

━━━ 核心设计 ━━━

  C0 (Cube):  多核切分 matM × matN → 2D 核网格 [numMCores × numNCores]
  V0 (Vector): 多核切分 matM only  → 1D 核组 [numMCores]
  流水:       每个 M-block 内, C0 所有 N-tile 完成后 → V0 开始处理 [singleM, full_N]

  ━━ 流水时序 ━━

  时间 →
       ┌──────── M-block 0 ────────┬──────── M-block 1 ────────┬── ...
  C0:  │ N-tile 0..4 并行计算       │ N-tile 0..4 并行计算       │
       │ [sM,sN]×5 核              │ [sM,sN]×5 核              │
       ├────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┤
  同步: │          N-axis barrier    │          N-axis barrier    │
       ├────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┤
  V0:  │              处理 [sM, N]   │              处理 [sM, N]  │
       │              dequant+SwiGLU │              dequant+SwiGLU│
       │              +quantize      │              +quantize      │

  ⚠️ C0 的 N-tile 间可流水 (Cube API 内部 tile), 但 V0 必须等完整 N 到齐

━━━ 核网格分配 ━━━

  coreNum = 20 (示例, 最大核数)
  核网格: numMCores × numNCores ≤ coreNum

  候选方案:
    | 方案 | numMCores | numNCores | singleM | singleN | Cube吞吐 | V0并行度 |
    |------|-----------|-----------|---------|---------|----------|----------|
    | A    | 4         | 5         | 1024    | ~1439   | 高       | 4        |
    | B    | 5         | 4         | ~820    | 1798    | 中高     | 5        |
    | C    | 2         | 8         | 2048    | ~899    | 最高     | 2        |

  推荐: 方案 B (numMCores=5, numNCores=4)
    理由:
      ✓ singleN=1798 足够大, Cube baseN 对齐良好
      ✓ V0 并行度=5, 后处理不会成为瓶颈
      ✓ 5×4=20 正好用满所有核

━━━ Block 大小推导 ━━━

  ━━ C0 Block (Stage 0): [singleM, singleN] ━━

    total_matM = 4096, total_matN = 7192
    numMCores = 5, numNCores = 4

    naive_singleM = ceil(4096 / 5) = 820
    naive_singleN = ceil(7192 / 4) = 1798

    Workspace 验证 (per M-block, all N assembled):
      singleM × N × 4 = 820 × 7192 × 4 ≈ 23.6 MB  (GM, ✓)

    双缓冲 (流水乒乓):
      2 × 23.6 MB ≈ 47.2 MB workspace (GM, ✓)

    Cube API 内部 tile:
      baseM, baseN from TCubeTiling
      每个 C0 核遍历 singleM/baseM × singleN/baseN 个 Cube tile

  ━━ V0 Block (Stage 1): [singleM, full_N] ━━

    V0 处理组装后的 [singleM, N] = [820, 7192]
    V0 多核: numMCores=5 个 AIV 各处理 1 个 M-block

    V0 内部 vec_chunk (UB 约束):
      单行 fp32 buffer: 7192 × 4 = 28.1 KB
      weightScale 常驻:  7192 × 4 = 28.1 KB
      Cast 双 buffer 瓶颈 → vec_chunk = 2 rows

━━━ Stage 划分 ━━━

  stage_count: 2

  Stage 0 (C0):
    cv_sequence: ["C0"]
    multi_core_split:
      axes: ["matM", "matN"]
      core_grid: "5 × 4 = 20"
      singleM: 820 (动态, 按 groupList 调整)
      singleN: 1798
    sync_after: true   ← N-axis barrier, 所有 N-tile 完成后同步

  Stage 1 (V0):
    cv_sequence: ["V0"]
    multi_core_split:
      axes: ["matM"]
      numMCores: 5
      singleM: 820 (与 Stage 0 对齐)
    sync_after: false

  流水:
    双缓冲乒乓: Stage 0 写 buffer A → 同步 → Stage 1 读 buffer A
                 Stage 0 同时写 buffer B → 同步 → Stage 1 读 buffer B

━━━ 设计原语 ━━━

  primitive: "{E}:matM:matN:[C0];matM:[V0]"

  含义:
    {E}:     实例轴 (block 不跨 group)
    matM:    外层多核切分 (Stage 0 和 Stage 1 共享 M 分核)
    matN:    Stage 0 额外的 N 多核切分 (仅 C0)
    [C0]     Stage 0: Cube matmul, 2D (M×N) 核网格
    ;        Stage 分隔 (N-axis barrier 同步)
    [V0]     Stage 1: Vector 后处理, 1D (M) 核分配

  annotations:
    splits:
      matM:
        type: "multi_core"
        allocation: "linear"
        shared_by: ["C0", "V0"]
        block_size: 820
        total_blocks: 5
        blocks_per_core: 1
        instance_constraint: "E"
        instance_handling: "核内按 groupList 拆分 sub-block"
        cube_api_params:
          physical_M: "matM_i"  (动态)
          physical_K: "matK"
          physical_N: "matN"

      matN:
        type: "multi_core"
        allocation: "linear"
        shared_by: ["C0"]
        block_size: 1798
        total_blocks: 4
        blocks_per_core: 1
        sync: "barrier_after_all_N_tiles"
        sync_reason: "V0 需完整 N 才能执行 SwiGLU"

      V0_vec_chunk:
        type: "intra_core"
        applies_to: ["V0"]
        axis: "matM"
        chunk_size: 2
        reason: "Cast 双 buffer + weightScale UB 约束"

    stages:
      - id: 0
        cv_sequence: ["C0"]
        sync_after: true
        description: "Cube matmul 2D (M×N) 多核"
      - id: 1
        cv_sequence: ["V0"]
        sync_after: false
        description: "Vector 后处理 1D (M) 多核, 流水跟随 Stage 0"

    pipeline:
      mode: "double_buffer"
      granularity: "per M-block"
      sync_point: "N-axis barrier between Stage 0 and Stage 1"

